            "review_title": "Review at Orenchi Bar & Lounge",
            "review_text": "Jane\nDa Nang, Vietnam4 contributions\n1\nGood Service and Drinks\nFeb 2020\nSuch a wonderful and nice Japanese bar in Da Nang ! i went there with my Japanese friend, we really like it. Staffs are so beautiful and friendly when serving us. Nice decoration and set up. Drinks are also very good taste and price. We actually enjoy when joining here. Highly recommend for everyone, especial Japanese guest and anyone like Japanese style. Be sure to come back !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 26, 2020",
